  }
 ],
 "description": "Reproduces Power BI measures: On Hand (Latest), Open PO Units, Sales R28 Units, Days of Cover, Products by Cover Bucket. Grain: Vendor[Vendor Name], Product[Product Name], Cover Bucket[Bucket]."
